# 4. ADVANCED LIQUIDITY INTELLIGENCE

Build a professional liquidity map based on observable price structures.

Support:

1. Buy-Side Liquidity (BSL).
2. Sell-Side Liquidity (SSL).
3. Equal Highs (EQH).
4. Equal Lows (EQL).
5. Previous Day High/Low.
